<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><title data-rh="true">Buy Research Peptides UK · Lab-Tested | UK Peptide Lab</title><meta data-rh="true" name="description" content="Buy Retatrutide (Reta), BPC-157, TB-500, Semax, MT2 &amp; more UK research peptides. 98%+ purity, third-party tested. Same-day dispatch, free delivery over £45."><meta data-rh="true" property="og:title" content="Buy Research Peptides UK · Lab-Tested | UK Peptide Lab"><meta data-rh="true" property="og:description" content="Buy Retatrutide (Reta), BPC-157, TB-500, Semax, MT2 &amp; more UK research peptides. 98%+ purity, third-party tested. Same-day dispatch, free delivery over £45."><meta data-rh="true" property="og:url" content="https://ukpeptidelab.co.uk/"><meta data-rh="true" property="og:type" content="website"><meta data-rh="true" property="og:site_name" content="UK Peptide Lab"><meta data-rh="true" property="og:image" content="https://ukpeptidelab.co.uk/og-image-square.webp"><meta data-rh="true" property="og:image:width" content="1200"><meta data-rh="true" property="og:image:height" content="1200"><meta data-rh="true" property="og:image:alt" content="UK Peptide Lab, Research Grade Peptides UK"><meta data-rh="true" property="og:locale" content="en_GB"><meta data-rh="true" name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"><meta data-rh="true" name="twitter:title" content="Buy Research Peptides UK · Lab-Tested | UK Peptide Lab"><meta data-rh="true" name="twitter:description" content="Buy Retatrutide (Reta), BPC-157, TB-500, Semax, MT2 &amp; more UK research peptides. 98%+ purity, third-party tested. Same-day dispatch, free delivery over £45."><meta data-rh="true" name="twitter:image" content="https://ukpeptidelab.co.uk/og-1200x630.webp"><meta data-rh="true" name="twitter:image:alt" content="UK Peptide Lab, Research Grade Peptides UK"><meta data-rh="true" name="robots" content="index, follow"><link data-rh="true" rel="canonical" href="https://ukpeptidelab.co.uk/"><script data-rh="true" type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://ukpeptidelab.co.uk/#organization","name":"UK Peptide Lab","url":"https://ukpeptidelab.co.uk/","description":"UK Peptide Lab is a UK-based supplier of research-grade peptides. Every batch third-party tested. Lab certificate on every product page. UK cold chain storage.","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://ukpeptidelab.co.uk/og-1200x630.webp","width":1200,"height":630},"contactPoint":{"@type":"ContactPoint","contactType":"customer service","url":"https://ukpeptidelab.co.uk/contact","areaServed":"GB","availableLanguage":["en-GB"]},"address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","streetAddress":"71-75 Shelton Street","addressLocality":"London","postalCode":"WC2H 9JQ","addressCountry":"GB"},"parentOrganization":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Oraxis Research Ltd","url":"https://find-and-update.company-information.service.gov.uk/company/17157816","identifier":{"@type":"PropertyValue","propertyID":"Companies House","value":"17157816"}},"areaServed":{"@type":"Country","name":"United Kingdom"},"knowsAbout":["Research peptides","Peptide chemistry","HPLC-UV analysis","Mass spectrometry","Lyophilised peptide handling"],"sameAs":["https://find-and-update.company-information.service.gov.uk/company/17157816"]},{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://ukpeptidelab.co.uk/#website","url":"https://ukpeptidelab.co.uk/","name":"UK Peptide Lab","publisher":{"@id":"https://ukpeptidelab.co.uk/#organization"},"potentialAction":{"@type":"SearchAction","target":{"@type":"EntryPoint","urlTemplate":"https://ukpeptidelab.co.uk/shop?q={search_term_string}"},"query-input":"required name=search_term_string"}},{"@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https://ukpeptidelab.co.uk/#faq","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I buy peptides in the UK?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Research peptides are legal to purchase in the UK for laboratory research purposes. They are not licensed medicines and are not intended for human or veterinary use. By placing an order you confirm you are aged 18 or over and that products will be used solely for research purposes."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Are your peptides high quality and lab-tested?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Every batch is independently tested by accredited third-party labs (Janoshik, Krause Analytical, Chromate Analytics) using HPLC and mass spectrometry before it ships. The full Certificate of Analysis is published on every product page. Most batches test at 99% purity or higher."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is it legal to buy research peptides in the UK?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Research peptides are legal to purchase in the UK for in-vitro laboratory research. They are not approved medicines and are not sold for personal, human, or veterinary use. Buyers must be aged 18 or over and agree to research-use-only terms at checkout."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Who can order from UK Peptide Lab?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We supply UK academic institutions, private laboratories, and qualified independent researchers. All buyers must be aged 18 or over and accept our research-use-only terms at checkout. We do not sell for personal, recreational, or therapeutic use."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How fast will my order arrive?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Orders placed before 2pm GMT on a working day are dispatched the same business day from our UK facility via Royal Mail Tracked 24. UK shipping is free on orders over £45. Peptides are stored at -20°C up to dispatch and packed in discreet, temperature-controlled packaging."}}]}]}</script>
