lass="mb-4 border-b border-border pb-2 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted-foreground">Metabolic Research</p><ul class="space-y-1.5"><li><a class="group flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 text-sm text-foreground transition-colors hover:text-primary" href="/product/5-amino-1mq"><span class="font-medium group-hover:underline">5-Amino-1MQ</span><span class="shrink-0 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-tight text-muted-foreground">50mg</span></a></li><li><a class="group flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 text-sm text-foreground transition-colors hover:text-primary" href="/product/glutathione"><span class="font-medium group-hover:underline">Glutathione</span><span class="shrink-0 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-tight text-muted-foreground">1500mg</span></a></li><li><a class="group flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 text-sm text-foreground transition-colors hover:text-primary" href="/product/l-carnitine"><span class="font-medium group-hover:underline">L-Carnitine</span><span class="shrink-0 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-tight text-muted-foreground">600mg</span></a></li><li><a class="group flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 text-sm text-foreground transition-colors hover:text-primary" href="/product/nad-plus"><span class="font-medium group-hover:underline">NAD+</span><span class="shrink-0 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-tight text-muted-foreground">500mg</span></a></li></ul></div><div><p class="mb-4 border-b border-border pb-2 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted-foreground">Accessories</p><ul class="space-y-1.5"><li><a class="group flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 text-sm text-foreground transition-colors hover:text-primary" href="/product/bacteriostatic-water"><span class="font-medium group-hover:underline">Bacteriostatic Water</span><span class="shrink-0 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-tight text-muted-foreground">10ml</span></a></li></ul></div></div><div class="mt-10 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-border pt-6"><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">32<!-- --> compounds in stock for UK delivery.</p><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-medium text-primary hover:underline" href="/shop">Open full shop <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-3.5 w-3.5"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><section class="border-y border-border py-20"><div class="section-container"><div class="mb-10 text-center"><span class="accent-label mb-2 block text-primary">Independently Lab-Tested</span><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-foreground lg:text-3xl">From synthesis to your inbox.</h2><p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-xl text-muted-foreground">Every batch passes a three-step independent verification before it ships. Tests are performed by accredited third-party laboratories: <a href="https://janoshik.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-primary hover:underline">Janoshik Analytical</a>, Krause Analytical and Chromate Analytics, using HPLC and mass spectrometry. The full Certificate of Analysis is published on every product page.</p></div><div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-xl border border-border p-6"><span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-primary">Step <!-- -->01</span><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-foreground">HPLC Purity</h3><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">High-Performance Liquid Chromatography quantifies the active peptide content. Reported to 0.1 percent. Failures below 98% are rejected.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-xl border border-border p-6"><span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-primary">Step <!-- -->02</span><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-foreground">Mass Spectrometry</h3><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Molecular weight verification confirms the compound's identity matches the declared sequence. Catches misidentified or substituted material.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-xl border border-border p-6"><span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-primary">Step <!-- -->03</span><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-foreground">Independent Lab</h3><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Both tests are performed by accredited third-party laboratories. Janoshik, Krause Analytical, Chromate Analytics. Certificates published.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-16 lg:py-20"><div class="section-container"><div class="mb-10 text-center"><span class="accent-label mb-2 block text-accent">Why Choose Us</span><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-foreground lg:text-3xl">Why UK Peptide Lab</h2></div><div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-background p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow hover:shadow-md"><div class="mb-4 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-accent/10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-flask-conical h-5 w-5 text-accent"><path d="M10 2v7.527a2 2 0 0 1-.211.896L4.72 20.55a1 1 0 0 0 .9 1.45h12.76a1 1 0 0 0 .9-1.45l-5.069-10.127A2 2 0 0 1 14 9.527V2"></path><path d="M8.5 2h7"></path><path d="M7 16h10"></path></svg></div><p class="mb-2 font-bold text-foreground">Verified Research-Grade Suppliers</p><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Sourced exclusively from verified research-grade suppliers. Every batch third-party tested.</p></div><div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-background p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow hover:shadow-md"><div class="mb-4 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-accent/10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-truck h-5 w-5 text-accent"><path d="M14 18V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2"></path><path d="M15 18H9"></path><path d="M19 18h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-3.65a1 1 0 0 0-.22-.624l-3.48-4.35A1 1 0 0 0 17.52 8H14"></path><circle cx="17" cy="18" r="2"></circle><circle cx="7" cy="18" r="2"></circle></svg></div><p class="mb-2 font-bold text-foreground">UK Based &amp; Fast Dispatch</p><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Orders placed before 2pm dispatched same working day via Royal Mail Tracked 24. Delivered in 1-2 working days.</p></div><div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-background p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow hover:shadow-md"><div class="mb-4 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-accent/10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-thermometer h-5 w-5 text-accent"><path d="M14 4v10.54a4 4 0 1 1-4 0V4a2 2 0 0 1 4 0Z"></path></svg></div><p class="mb-2 font-bold text-foreground">Temperature-Controlled Storage</p><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">All peptides stored at -20°C from receipt to dispatch to preserve potency and stability.</p></div><div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-background p-6 shadow-sm transition-shadow hover:shadow-md"><div class="mb-4 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-accent/10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-file-check h-5 w-5 text-accent"><path d="M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z"></path><path d="M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4"></path><path d="m9 15 2 2 4-4"></path></svg></div><p class="mb-2 font-bold text-foreground">Full Batch Traceability</p><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Certificate published on each product page for every product and batch.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="border-y border-border bg-secondary py-16 lg:py-20"><div class="section-container"><div class="mb-10 text-center"><span class="accent-label mb-2 block text-primary">Categories</span><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-foreground lg:text-3xl">Browse by Category</h2></div><div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3"><a class="clinical-card-hover flex items-center justify-between" href="/category/peptides"><div><p class="font-bold text-foreground">Peptides</p><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">19<!-- --> products</p></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-primary"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><a class="clinical-card-hover flex items-center justify-between" href="/category/growth-hormone-secretagogues"><div><p class="font-bold text-foreground">Growth Hormone Secretagogues</p><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">6<!-- --> products</p></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-primary"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><a class="clinical-card-hover flex items-center justify-between" href="/category/nootropic-peptides"><div><p class="font-bold text-foreground">Nootropic Peptides</p><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">