 class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">UK buying guide</p></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-primary"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><a class="clinical-card-hover flex items-center justify-between" href="/buy/klow-uk"><div><p class="font-bold text-foreground">KLOW</p><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">UK buying guide</p></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-primary"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><a class="clinical-card-hover flex items-center justify-between" href="/buy/bpc-157-tb-500-uk"><div><p class="font-bold text-foreground">BPC-157 + TB-500</p><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">UK buying guide</p></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-primary"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><a class="clinical-card-hover flex items-center justify-between" href="/buy/bacteriostatic-water-uk"><div><p class="font-bold text-foreground">Bacteriostatic Water</p><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">UK buying guide</p></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-primary"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><section class="py-24 lg:py-28"><div class="section-container"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl rounded-2xl border bg-card px-8 py-16 text-center lg:px-12"><span class="accent-label mb-2 block text-primary">Purity Standard</span><h2 class="mb-5 text-3xl font-bold leading-tight text-foreground lg:text-4xl">Third-party verified, <span class="text-muted-foreground">every single batch.</span></h2><p class="mx-auto mb-8 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Every compound in our catalogue is third-party tested. Certificates of Analysis available for all products.</p><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/90 h-10 px-4 py-2 rounded-full" href="/shop">Shop Collection <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right ml-2 h-4 w-4"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><section class="border-t border-border bg-secondary/20 py-16 lg:py-20"><div class="section-container"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl"><span class="accent-label mb-2 block text-primary">About Us</span><h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-bold text-foreground lg:text-3xl">A UK peptide supplier built on verification</h2><div class="space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"><p>UK Peptide Lab is a UK-based supplier of research-grade peptides, operated by Oraxis Research Ltd and built around a simple principle: researchers should be able to verify exactly what is in the vial before they place an order. Every batch we release is analysed by independent, accredited laboratories using HPLC-UV and mass spectrometry, and the resulting Certificate of Analysis is published openly on the product page rather than held back behind a support request.</p><p>Because everything is stocked and dispatched from within the United Kingdom, orders placed before 2pm on a working day leave our facility the same afternoon by Royal Mail Tracked 24, packed discreetly and shipped from cold-chain storage held at -20°C until the moment of dispatch. That combination of published third-party testing, domestic stock, and traceable delivery is what separates a verified supplier from a reseller.</p><p>You can read <a class="text-primary hover:underline" href="/about">the full story behind UK Peptide Lab</a>, or see <a class="text-primary hover:underline" href="/quality">how every batch is tested and documented</a> before it is released for sale.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="border-t border-border py-16 lg:py-24"><div class="section-container"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center"><div class="order-2 lg:order-1"><img src="/images/bpc-157-v20260509.webp?v=20260627" alt="BPC-157 5mg lyophilised research peptide vial" width="1500" height="1875" class="w-full h-auto rounded-2xl" loading="lazy"></div><div class="order-1 lg:order-2"><span class="accent-label mb-2 block text-primary">FAQ</span><h2 class="mb-8 text-3xl font-bold leading-tight text-foreground lg:text-4xl">Here's <span class="text-muted-foreground">what you should know.</span></h2><div class="w-full" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="border-b"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-:Rjq2bd:" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-:R3q2bd:" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between py-4 transition-all hover:underline [&amp;[data-state=open]>svg]:rotate-180 text-left text-base font