accent-label mb-2 block text-primary">Free Guide</span><h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold text-foreground">Get Our Free Peptide Reconstitution Guide</h2><p class="mx-auto mb-8 max-w-md text-muted-foreground">Plus be first to know about new batches, product launches, and research content.</p><form class="mx-auto flex max-w-md gap-3"><div aria-hidden="true" style="position:absolute;left:-9999px;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;opacity:0"><label for="newsletter-website">Website (leave blank)</label><input id="newsletter-website" name="website" type="text" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" value=""></div><label for="newsletter-email" class="sr-only">Email address</label><input id="newsletter-email" type="email" placeholder="Enter your email" required="" class="flex-1 rounded-md border border-border bg-background px-4 py-2.5 text-sm text-foreground placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/30" value=""><button type="submit" class="shrink-0 rounded-md bg-primary px-6 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-foreground transition-colors hover:bg-primary/90 disabled:opacity-50">Subscribe</button></form><p class="mt-3 text-xs text-muted-foreground">No spam. Unsubscribe at any time.</p></div></section></div></main><footer role="contentinfo" class="bg-secondary/40 text-foreground border-t border-border"><div class="border-b border-border"><div class="section-container py-6 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between gap-3"><p class="italic text-muted-foreground text-sm">All products supplied for laboratory research use only. Not for human consumption or veterinary use.</p><div id="trustpilot-footer-widget" class="min-h-[24px]"></div></div></div><div class="section-container"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-12 pt-16 lg:pt-20 pb-12"><div><a aria-label="UK Peptide Lab home" href="/"><img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3c?xml%20version='1.0'%20encoding='utf-8'?%3e%3csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.